@@ -98,6 +98,12 @@ The following options are provided to configure the output:
 * **`SEPARATOR`**:
     The text string used to set the footnote separator. Defaults to `:`.
 
+* **`USE_DEFINITION_ORDER`**:
+    If `True`, footnotes are numbered and listed in the order they are defined.
+    If `False`, footnotes are numbered and listed in the order they are first
+    referenced in the document. Footnotes which are defined but never
+    referenced are listed last, in definition order. Defaults to `False`.
+
